WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:00.534 --> 00:00:03.270 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il participe en deux ans à deux

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:06.473 size:53% position:73% line:53%
albums extraordinaires de

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:06.473 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'histoire musicale du Québec.

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:06.473 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et il y en a eu plein d'autres.

00:00:11.545 --> 00:00:14.314 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Si la France a son pompidou,

00:00:12.546 --> 00:00:15.349 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le Québec a son Robidoux :

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:16.383 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Michel Robidoux!

00:00:14.615 --> 00:00:17.417 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le guitariste Michel Robidoux

00:00:15.649 --> 00:00:18.452 size:53% position:73% line:53%
a fait les 400 coups avec

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:19.486 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Robert Charlebois qui,

00:00:17.718 --> 00:00:20.487 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aujourd'hui, pleure

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:21.555 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le départ d'un complice.

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:22.589 size:53% position:73% line:53%
(applaudissements)

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:23.590 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ROBERT CHARLEBOIS,

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:24.624 size:53% position:73% line:53%
auteur-compositeur-interprète

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:25.659 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Moi, musicalement, c'est

00:00:23.891 --> 00:00:26.693 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le premier qui m'a offert

00:00:24.925 --> 00:00:27.728 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une guitare électrique,

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:28.762 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une ES-135, la même guitare

00:00:26.994 --> 00:00:29.796 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Gibson Cutaway d'Elvis.

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:30.831 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Donc, je l'ai dans l'épaule

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:31.865 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour le reste de ma vie!

00:00:30.097 --> 00:00:33.066 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ Mes bras te servent d'abri ♪

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:34.301 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Fils du chanteur Fernand

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:35.535 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Robidoux, Michel Robidoux

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:36.737 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avait la musique dans le sang.

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:37.971 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ ♪ ♪

00:00:35.836 --> 00:00:39.206 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 Dès le début des années 60,

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:40.440 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il a accompagné de nombreux

00:00:38.272 --> 00:00:41.675 size:53% position:73% line:53%
artistes et composé la musique

00:00:39.506 --> 00:00:42.909 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de près de 300 chansons, dont

00:00:40.741 --> 00:00:44.144 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Le chat du café des artistes"

00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:45.379 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et "Le petit roi", chansons

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:46.613 size:53% position:73% line:53%
écrites et chantées

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:47.814 size:53% position:73% line:53%
par Jean-Pierre Ferland.

00:00:45.679 --> 00:00:49.049 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ Dans mon âme et dedans

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:50.284 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ma tête ♪

00:00:48.115 --> 00:00:51.551 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ Il y avait autrefois

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:52.786 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un petit roi ♪

00:00:50.584 --> 00:00:53.987 size:53% position:73% line:53%
JEAN-PIERRE FERLAND,

00:00:51.852 --> 00:00:55.222 size:53% position:73% line:53%
auteur-compositeur-interprète

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:56.456 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est lui qui m'a montré

00:00:54.288 --> 00:00:57.691 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à jouer de la guitare,

00:00:55.522 --> 00:00:58.925 size:53% position:73% line:53%
mais à un moment donné,

00:00:56.757 --> 00:01:00.160 size:53% position:73% line:53%
je le respectais tellement

00:00:57.991 --> 00:01:01.395 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que je le laissais jouer

00:00:59.226 --> 00:01:02.629 size:53% position:73% line:53%
la guitare et je lui demandais

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:03.864 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de faire la musique.

00:01:01.695 --> 00:01:05.065 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ Je rêve à Rio ♪

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:06.266 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Michel Robidoux a joué sur un

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:07.567 size:53% position:73% line:53%
total de 793 pièces musicales.

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:08.769 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il était l'ami de Claude Dubois,

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:10.003 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Raôul Duguay, Stéphane Venne

00:01:07.868 --> 00:01:11.238 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et Pierre Létourneau.

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:12.472 size:53% position:73% line:53%
PIERRE LÉTOURNEAU,

00:01:10.304 --> 00:01:13.707 size:53% position:73% line:53%
auteur-compositeur-interprète

00:01:11.538 --> 00:01:14.941 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Il pouvait passer cinq heures

00:01:12.773 --> 00:01:16.143 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en studio avec une concentration

00:01:14.007 --> 00:01:19.446 size:53% position:73% line:53%
toujours égale.

00:01:16.043 --> 00:01:20.647 size:53% position:73% line:53%
MOUFFE

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:21.882 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'était la musique.

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:23.116 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Sa passion, c'était la musique.

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:24.351 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Il avait toujours une guitare

00:01:22.182 --> 00:01:25.585 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à la main, il était toujours

00:01:23.417 --> 00:01:26.820 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en train de jouer, de composer

00:01:24.651 --> 00:01:30.357 size:53% position:73% line:53%
quelque chose, de fredonner.

00:01:25.886 --> 00:01:31.558 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'était sa maîtresse. Sa vraie

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:32.793 size:53% position:73% line:53%
maîtresse, c'était la musique.

00:01:30.657 --> 00:01:34.027 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ Passe-Montagne

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:35.262 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aime les papillons ♪

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:36.496 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- À la fin des années 70,

00:01:34.328 --> 00:01:37.731 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il va composer des chansons

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:38.965 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour l'émission "Passe-Partout"

00:01:36.797 --> 00:01:40.200 size:53% position:73% line:53%
en compagnie de Pierre

00:01:38.031 --> 00:01:41.435 size:53% position:73% line:53%
F. Brault.

00:01:39.266 --> 00:01:42.669 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ Ce soir je fais l'amour ♪

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:43.904 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- En 2017, il a signé un premier

00:01:41.735 --> 00:01:45.138 size:53% position:73% line:53%
album, entouré d'artistes

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:46.373 size:53% position:73% line:53%
qui l'admirent, dont

00:01:44.204 --> 00:01:47.607 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Pierre Lapointe.

00:01:45.439 --> 00:01:48.842 size:53% position:73% line:53%
PIERRE LAPOINTE,

00:01:46.673 --> 00:01:50.077 size:53% position:73% line:53%
auteur-compositeur-interprète

00:01:47.908 --> 00:01:51.311 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Il a travaillé avec tout

00:01:49.142 --> 00:01:52.546 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le monde, il a connu tout

00:01:50.377 --> 00:01:53.780 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le monde, puis il a vu tout

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:55.015 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le monde en concert. Et puis,

00:01:52.846 --> 00:01:56.249 size:53% position:73% line:53%
si je fais le métier que je fais

00:01:54.081 --> 00:01:57.484 size:53% position:73% line:53%
aujourd'hui, comme je le fais,

00:01:55.315 --> 00:01:58.718 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'est en partie parce qu'il y a

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:59.953 size:53% position:73% line:53%
eu des gens comme

00:01:57.784 --> 00:02:03.123 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Michel Robidoux.

00:01:59.019 --> 00:02:04.324 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ Tes lèvres savaient trop

00:02:00.253 --> 00:02:05.559 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tous les serments décevants ♪

00:02:03.423 --> 00:02:06.760 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Malade depuis plusieurs mois,

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:07.995 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Michel Robidoux nous a quittés

00:02:05.859 --> 00:02:09.229 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à l'âge de 78 ans.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:11.431 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Je suis vraiment tout

00:02:08.295 --> 00:02:14.301 size:53% position:73% line:53%
à l'envers.

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:15.502 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Repose en paix, Michel.

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:19.840 size:53% position:73% line:53%
♪ ♪ ♪

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:19.840 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ici Louis-Philippe Ouimet,

00:02:15.802 --> 00:02:19.840 size:53% position:73% line:53%
  Radio-Canada, Montréal.

